# GitHub Linguist classifies .mjs as JavaScript. In this repository that is
# misleading: the site is Astro, and the overwhelming majority of .mjs bytes are
# the Playwright and Vitest suites under test/ rather than anything the browser loads.
# Measured on main: 1,103,549 bytes of .mjs under test/ against 104,239 under src/lib.
#
# src/** is Astro so the language bar reports the framework that actually renders the
# site, and the test suites are marked undetectable so tooling does not outvote it.
src/**            linguist-language=Astro
test/**           linguist-detectable=false
scripts/**        linguist-detectable=false
*.config.mjs      linguist-detectable=false